      "generated_answer": "Based on the text provided and historical context, Peter the Great did not adopt the democratic reforms or constitutional limits he observed in Western Europe. Instead, he intensified his autocratic control over Russia, which included the continued reliance on and expansion of the institution of **serfdom** to fuel his military and industrial projects.\n\n\\boxed{E}",
