    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In the author's two-hour movie representing the history of the universe, when do the earliest members of the human family appear?\n\nOptions: \nA. during the final minute of the film\nB. 90 minutes into the film\nC. about half way through the film\nD. during the final 30 seconds of the film\nE. in the first hour of the film\nF. during the final 3 seconds of the film\nG. at the end of the film\nH. during the final 10 minutes of the film\nI. at the beginning of the film\nJ. 30 minutes into the film\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
