      "generated_answer": "Based on the common analogy of the \"Cosmic Calendar\" or \"Cosmic Movie\" used in science communication (most famously by David Christian in Big History or Carl Sagan), the history of the universe is scaled to show that human history occurs at the very end. On a two-hour scale, the earliest hominids appear only in the final moments, specifically within the last few seconds.\n\nThe correct letter choice is \\boxed{F}.",
