    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following was the greatest advantage of using fire in human evolution?\n\nOptions: \nA. Fire can be used in warfare and to clear fields.\nB. Fire was used to create the first forms of currency.\nC. Fire allowed early humans to fly kites at night.\nD. Fire was used to create intricate cave paintings.\nE. Fire makes meat more digestible and kills bacteria.\nF. Fire was used to scare away insects and pests.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
