      "generated_answer": "The text describes the Vietnam War from the perspective of John Kerry in 1971. This conflict was a primary application of the **Containment** policy, which sought to prevent the spread of communism during the Cold War. While the Domino Theory (F) and Truman Doctrine (H) are related, Containment (B) is the overarching strategic doctrine that governed U.S. intervention in Southeast Asia.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
