    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which archaeological method is best for identifying large-scale land modifications?\n\nOptions: \nA. stratigraphic analysis\nB. resistivity survey\nC. metal detectors\nD. ground-penetrating radar\nE. underwater archaeology\nF. aerial photography\nG. excavation\nH. proton magnetometers\nI. surface survey\nJ. test pits\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
