      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is **A**. Jane Addams describes a cooperative boarding club established specifically to help workers \"stand behind each other\" during strikes, highlighting the importance of collective bargaining and mutual aid in labor disputes. This emphasis on worker solidarity and the ability to sustain organized labor actions aligns most directly with the goal of securing greater rights for unions.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
