      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is **C**.\n\nPizarro arrived in the Inca Empire shortly after a devastating civil war between the brothers Huáscar and Atahualpa, which had depleted the empire's resources and fractured its leadership. While other factors like disease and technology played roles, the internal instability of the empire was the primary factor that allowed a small group of Spaniards to seize control.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
