    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following characteristics of modern humans is the most ancient, pre-dating the Late Stone Age, the Upper Paleolithic and even anatomically modern humans?\n\nOptions: \nA. establishment of permanent settlements\nB. development of agriculture\nC. domestication of animals\nD. creation of written language\nE. symbolic expression through the production of art\nF. development of complex social hierarchies\nG. elaborate burials\nH. improved stone tool technologies\nI. larger sites with larger populations\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
