      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumJumps(nums, target):\n    n = len(nums)\n    \n    # dp[i] represents the maximum number of jumps to reach index i\n    dp = [-1] * n\n    dp[0] = 0  # Starting position, 0 jumps needed\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        if dp[i] == -1:  # Can't reach this position\n            continue\n            \n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            diff = nums[j] - nums[i]\n            if -target <= diff <= target:\n                if dp[i] + 1 > dp[j]:\n                    dp[j] = dp[i] + 1\n    \n    return dp[n - 1]\n```",
