    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef findMinimumOperations(s1, s2, s3):\n    # Check if the first character is the same for all strings\n    if s1[0] != s2[0] or s1[0] != s3[0]:\n        return -1\n    \n    # Find the longest common prefix\n    i = 0\n    min_len = min(len(s1), len(s2), len(s3))\n    \n    while i < min_len and s1[i] == s2[i] == s3[i]:\n        i += 1\n    \n    # The common prefix length is i\n    # Total operations needed is the sum of characters to remove from each string\n    total_operations = (len(s1) - i) + (len(s2) - i) + (len(s3) - i)\n    \n    return total_operations\n```",
