      "generated_answer": "The state equation is $\\dot{X} = AX + bu(t)$, where $A = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$, $b = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}$, and $X_0 = \\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix}$. The solution is $X(t) = e^{At}X_0 + \\int_0^t e^{A(t-\\tau)}b \\delta(\\tau) d\\tau = e^{At}X_0 + e^{At}b$. Given $e^{At} = \\mathcal{L}^{-1}\\{(sI-A)^{-1}\\} = \\mathcal{L}^{-1}\\left\\{ \\begin{pmatrix} \\frac{1}{s-1} & 0 \\\\ \\frac{2}{s(s-1)} & \\frac{1}{s} \\end{pmatrix} \\right\\} = \\begin{pmatrix} e^t & 0 \\\\ 2(e^t-1) & 1 \\end{pmatrix}$, the result for $X(0^+) = X_0 + b$ is $\\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 0 \\end{pmatrix} + \\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix}$. As the options list single values, the output in the second component is 2.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
