    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "For resistors in parallel, the total resistance $ R_{\\text{total}} $ is calculated as:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{R_{\\text{total}}} = \\frac{1}{10} + \\frac{1}{15} + \\frac{1}{20} + \\frac{1}{25} + \\frac{1}{30}\n$$\n\nCalculating the sum:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{10} = 0.1,\\ \\frac{1}{15} \\approx 0.0667,\\ \\frac{1}{20} = 0.05,\\ \\frac{1}{25} = 0.04,\\ \\frac{1}{30} \\approx 0.0333\n$$\n\n$$\n\\Rightarrow \\text{Sum} \\approx 0.1 + 0.0667 + 0.05 + 0.04 + 0.0333 = 0.29\n$$\n\n$$\nR_{\\text{total}} \\approx \\frac{1}{0.29} \\approx 3.45\\ \\text{ohms}\n$$\n\nThis is closest to **3.46 ohms**.\n\n\\boxed{A}",
