    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "To represent 110 different codewords, we need at least $ \\lceil \\log_2(110) \\rceil = 7 $ bits, since $ 2^7 = 128 \\geq 110 $. The efficiency is calculated as $ \\frac{110}{128} \\times 100 \\approx 85.9\\% $, which is closest to 89%. Thus, 7 bits with 89% efficiency is the best match.\n\n\\boxed{I}",
