    "prediction": "Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-Next",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Luke is guided by the spiritual presence and counsel of Obi-Wan Kenobi’s Force spirit during the final moments of the Death Star trench run. This guidance helps him ignore the targeting computer and trust his instincts, allowing him to use the Force to make the precise shot. As a result, he successfully destroys the Death Star’s vulnerable exhaust port.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{The spiritual guidance of Obi-Wan Kenobi's Force spirit}}",
