      "generated_answer": "Nick and his family move to a trailer park in Clearlake because Jerry owes money to a group of sailors, and they flee Oakland to avoid consequences. This relocation brings Nick into contact with Sheeni Saunders, whom he becomes romantically involved with. The move is explicitly triggered by Jerry’s debt to the sailors.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{Because Jerry owes money to a group of sailors and they need to flee Oakland to avoid the consequences.}}",
