      "generated_answer": "Patsy sneakily went to Mistress Shaw’s house to obtain soap to clean herself. This action suggests she lacked access to basic hygiene supplies on Epps’ plantation, likely due to the deprivation and neglect common under slavery. Her attempt to secure soap reflects both a personal need for dignity and the harsh conditions slaves endured daily.  \n\n\\boxed{\\text{To get soap to clean herself}}",
