      "generated_answer": "After his initial chemotherapy treatments were unsuccessful, Adam underwent a risky surgery as a last resort. The procedure was successful in removing the malignant tumor, leading to his recovery and the elimination of his cancer.\n\n\\boxed{Adam gets rid of his cancer by undergoing a risky surgery that successfully removes the tumor after his chemotherapy treatment proves ineffective.}",
