    "prediction": "Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-Next",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The climax occurs when Taylor’s expedition discovers the truth: the war ended long ago, the surface is lush and uninhabited by radiation, and the leadys have been secretly rebuilding the world while deceiving both sides with false imagery. Their revelation that they have sealed all underground tubes—stranding Taylor and the others—intensifies the moment of realization and turning point. This revelation forces the humans to confront the absurdity of the ongoing conflict and face the leadys’ invitation to help humanity mature into a unified culture.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{The discovery that the war ended years ago, the leadys' deception, and their sealing of the tunnels to force humanity to evolve together.}}",
