    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The United States acquired the Oregon Territory through diplomatic negotiations with Great Britain, which had jointly occupied the region with the U.S. since 1818. The dispute was resolved by the Oregon Treaty of 1846, in which Britain ceded the territory south of the 49th parallel to the United States. This makes the correct answer:\n\n\\boxed{H}",
